flowchart LR
	CCR["The ccr listener - prepend: true,<br/>compressing results behind the CCR marker"]
	COACH["The coach tools/post-execute listener - plain"]
	OBS["It observes the (possibly compressed) result."]
	T1["Tier-1 notes - append-only additionalContexts"]
